          "id": 1636067135,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Opening a capture file as a file mean the user is interested about the file format itself. Why would you want to dissect the next layer by default? Moreover it clutters the INFO column are the whole file is seen as a single \"packet\" in Wirehark GUI.",
